OL,3,GNEWSAWales NHS gender surgeries paused
OL,4,Afor review into referral numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh Gender Service has paused
OL,7,Fscheduled and new referrals for
OL,8,Fgender-affirming surgeries, after the
OL,9,Fhealth board in charge reported
OL,10,F"concerns" about the number of
OL,11,Freferrals being made.
OL,13,FData from 2025-26 indicated
OL,14,F"significantly higher rates of referral
OL,15,Ffor gender affirming surgery...
OL,16,Fcompared with English gender services",
OL,17,Fsaid Cardiff and Vale University Health
OL,18,FBoard.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
