OL,3,GNEWSAWales NHS gender surgeries paused
OL,4,Afor review into referral numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS Wales Joint Commissioning
OL,7,FCommittee has requested an independent
OL,8,Fclinical review after identifying
OL,9,F"matters" through routine "assurance
OL,10,Fprocesses".
OL,12,FThe health board said patients should
OL,13,Fstill attend scheduled appointments and
OL,14,Fother parts of the service would
OL,15,Fcontinue to operate, including hormone
OL,16,Ftherapy support.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
